            "value" : "Designated Driver"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Трезвый водитель"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ach_sober_days_year_300_desc" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "300 sober days. Something is clearly wrong with you."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "300 дней. С тобой явно что-то не так."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ach_sober_days_year_300_title" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Entered Into The Annals"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Занесенный в анналы"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ach_sober_month_1_desc" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You started the year without a hangover. Your colleagues don't believe you. That's their problem."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ты начал год без похмелья. Коллеги не верят. Это их проблемы."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ach_sober_month_1_title" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hangover-Free Start"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Трезвый старт"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ach_sober_month_2_desc" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "February 23 is a man's day. You're a man. You drink water. The logic is flawless."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "23 февраля — мужской день. Ты мужчина. Пьёшь воду. Логика безупречна."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ach_sober_month_2_title" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Defender of Mineral Water"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Защитник минералки"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ach_sober_month_3_desc" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "March 8. Women get flowers. You get a clear head. A fair exchange, right? Right?"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "8 марта. Женщинам цветы. Тебе ясная голова. Честный обмен, да? Да?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ach_sober_month_3_title" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mimosa Without Champagne"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Мимоза без шампанского"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ach_sober_month_4_desc" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "April 1st. The joke is that you're still sober. Ha ha. Very funny."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1 апреля. Шутка в том, что ты всё ещё трезв. Ха-ха. Очень смешно."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ach_sober_month_4_title" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Not a Fool's Joke"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Не шутка дурака"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ach_sober_month_5_desc" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "May holidays. The meat is great. The company is great. And no hangover. You can handle it."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Майские. Мясо отличное. Компания отличная. И никакого похмелья. Ты справишься."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ach_sober_month_5_title" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Barbecue Without Bitterness"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Шашлык без горечи"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ach_sober_month_6_desc" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "June, sun, beer ads left and right. And you — with sparkling water. Hydromet center shrugs."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Июнь, солнце, реклама пива на каждом шагу. А ты — с газировкой. Гидрометцентр пожимает плечами."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ach_sober_month_6_title" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Summer Anomaly"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Летняя аномалия"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ach_sober_month_7_desc" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "July is dry by name and by fact. Your mouth is dry. Your conscience is clear. Acceptable trade."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Июль сухой и по названию, и по факту. Во рту сухо. Совесть чиста. Приемлемый обмен."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ach_sober_month_7_title" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dry But Alive"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Сухой, но живой"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ach_sober_month_8_desc" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "August. Tomatoes, cucumbers, sober evenings. Your neighbors drink moonshine. You drink kvass. Different paths, same dacha."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Август. Помидоры, огурцы, трезвые вечера. Соседи пьют самогон. Ты пьёшь квас. Разные пути, одна дача."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ach_sober_month_8_title" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dacha Normal Guy"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Дачный нормальный"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ach_sober_month_9_desc" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "September 1st. Children go to school. You go to a sober month. Both of you are a little nervous. But both of you can do it."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1 сентября. Дети идут в школу. Ты идёшь в трезвый месяц. Оба немного нервничаете. Но у обоих получится."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ach_sober_month_9_title" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "First-Grader's Morning"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Утро первоклашки"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ach_sober_month_10_desc" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "October. Leaves are falling. Willpower stays. Surprisingly."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Октябрь. Листья падают. Сила воли остаётся. Как ни странно."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ach_sober_month_10_title" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Leaf Fall, Will Fall?"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Листопад, а воля?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ach_sober_month_11_desc" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "November 4 — National Unity Day. You are united with your sobriety. That's still unity. Counts."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "4 ноября — День народного единства. Ты един со своей трезвостью. Это тоже единство. Считается."
          }
        }
